; CK_GOLD_COMBO - FundedNext Stellar 2-Step FUNDED-STAGE set (from experiments/combo_fnext_02f, ledger seq226/227)
; USE THIS ONLY on the live FUNDED account. For the CHALLENGE (Step 1 + Step 2) use the 0.03 set:
;   experiments/combo_fnext_03/CK_GOLD_COMBO_FundedNext.set
; Difference vs the challenge set: FIX lot 0.03 -> 0.02 (single change), to buy a daily-loss safety buffer.
; Why: at 0.03 the worst single day (2026-01-13) had a conservative combined-floating draw of ~$293 (over the
;      $250 = 5%-of-initial daily line) because FIX + the DT swing were open together. At 0.02 that worst day
;      drops to -$220.66, and across the whole year 0 days touch $250 (realized OR conservative floating),
;      min equity $4,980 (static floor $4,500 never threatened).
; Backtest (real ticks, last1y, $5k): whole run +64.7%/yr; FUNDED slice +$2,703/329d => ~$246/mo,
;      your take ~$197/mo @80% (~$222/mo @90%). Firm: NO Goat Guard; daily 5% of INITIAL incl floating; max 10% STATIC.
; Combo_BlockEntryHours=0,1 (seq252/253): blocks new entries in the 00:00-02:00 server SETTLEMENT window
;   (FundedNext prohibits profit generated disproportionately in that low-liquidity "dead zone"). Screened
;   on this 0.02 config: net 3335 -> 3308 (only -0.8%), settlement-window trades 17 -> 0, worst day + breaches
;   UNCHANGED -> compliant-by-construction, near-zero cost, more robust on the real feed.
; NOTE: real money only after the forward-demo passes on the real FundedNext feed AND human approval (ledger seq223).
